# Repository text is stored with LF and checked out with LF on every platform.
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF sources, and
# gofmt reports every .go file as needing formatting, so the gofmt gate in CI
# cannot be reproduced locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
